 Create Order", "items": ["Client POSTs CreateOrderRequest with JWT auth", "Calculates Haversine distance + tiered delivery fee", "Evaluates hub resource readiness (queue, battery, drone)", "Order saved: status=PENDING, payment_status=UNPAID", "Notifications sent to customer + all operators"]}, {"dot": "cyan", "title": "Phase 2 — PayOS Checkout", "items": ["Client calls checkout with order_id from Phase 1", "Authorization: only order owner or Admin can pay", "Idempotent: returns existing link if already PENDING", "PayOS SDK creates payment link with VietQR data", "Saves qr_code, checkout_url, bin, account_number to DB"]}, {"dot": "rose", "title": "Guards & Edge Cases", "items": ["400 — payload_kg out of range (0.1–10 kg)", "404 — Hub not found or Order not found", "403 — non-owner tries to pay (not Admin)", "400 — already PAID or delivery_fee not set", "Payment link is separate from order creation — 2 API calls"]}, {"dot": "violet", "title": "Payment & Order Status Flow", "items": ["Order: PENDING → AWAITING_DROP_OFF → AT_HUB → IN_DELIVERY → DELIVERED", "Payment: UNPAID → PENDING → PAID (webhook code '00') | FAILED | CANCELLED", "Webhook verifies HMAC-SHA256, finds order by payment_order_code", "Customer scans QR or visits checkout_url to pay via bank transfer"]}]}